{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hours of gathering and exploration in a dystopian horror-scape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of fps action and survival horror in an endless expanse of brutalist architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An oppressive atmosphere of isolation in a treacherous ever-changing environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse creatures able to stalk, hunt, and devour the unprepared player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story hidden between the cracks of concrete revealing humanity\u2019s downfall</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/5633abbae801afeb392d563ce7051a76.poster.avif?t=1764675033\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/5633abbae801afeb392d563ce7051a76.webm?t=1764675033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/5633abbae801afeb392d563ce7051a76.mp4?t=1764675033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARVEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge broken machines and twisted horrors for resources rusty and alien. Choose what to scrap and what to collect, praying you find extraction chambers to save your precious loot. Will you take the gambles and boons of the maze, or embrace a slow risk-free grind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/b419dfab880001d34c5c63c2f6210056.poster.avif?t=1764675033\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/b419dfab880001d34c5c63c2f6210056.webm?t=1764675033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/b419dfab880001d34c5c63c2f6210056.mp4?t=1764675033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your &lt;HUB&gt; to upgrade and evolve your weaponry. Fuse artifacts with your tools to unlock new attributes and powers. Grow or perish. But what are you willing to sacrifice for your survival? Take care human, lest you become something else\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/2a51adeaca2b66e85e4f9aceadda6e5b.poster.avif?t=1764675033\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/2a51adeaca2b66e85e4f9aceadda6e5b.webm?t=1764675033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/2a51adeaca2b66e85e4f9aceadda6e5b.mp4?t=1764675033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate this maze of horror, discover new environments hidden in the depths, and hunt greater monstrosities\u2026 or become the hunted. Watch your step. This place wasn\u2019t built for humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/f9b5078695a338ab171e6533d8e7b13c.poster.avif?t=1764675033\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/extras/f9b5078695a338ab171e6533d8e7b13c.webm?t=1764675033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour