7740/76e1b5757e4c263235470e465370bd66643f2205/ss_76e1b5757e4c263235470e465370bd66643f2205.600x338.jpg?t=1764675033"}],"short_description":"Discover &quot;The Domain&quot;, an endless expanse of cold concrete, twisted monsters, chaotic anomalies, and powerful artifacts. Harvest resources from this brutalist jungle (inspired by the \u201cBLAME!\u201d manga) to upgrade your weaponry. Will you unveil the horrors that lie at its core, or die trying?","steam_appid":3447740,"support_info":{"email":"jinice99@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}